{"id":"dbd3c82cd2473f13","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-bm-strategy.md","title":"BM 策略、遵循关系与必胜谓词","display":"df-bm-strategy — BM 策略、遵循关系与必胜谓词","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-bm-strategy","aliases":["20-df-bm-strategy"],"display":"df-bm-strategy — BM 策略、遵循关系与必胜谓词","chapter":"14","section":"14.1.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"§14.1.3 的策略定义展开","source_printed_pages":[212,213],"source_pdf_pages":[241,242],"depends_on":["[[20-df-bm-game]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-bm-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-bm-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bm-strategy — BM 策略、遵循关系与必胜谓词"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§14.1.3 的策略定义展开"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>212</span><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>241</span><span>242</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f02918e259cd9a8e\" href=\"?note=f02918e259cd9a8e\" title=\"20-df-bm-game\">20-df-bm-game</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 为合法非空有限历史 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_n)\">\\((\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_n)\\)</span> 的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_I=\\{h\\in H:n\\text{ 奇}\\}\">\\(H_I=\\{h\\in H:n\\text{ 奇}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{II}=\\{h\\in H:n\\text{ 偶}\\}\">\\(H_{II}=\\{h\\in H:n\\text{ 偶}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{I,II\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{I,II\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f02918e259cd9a8e\" href=\"?note=f02918e259cd9a8e\" title=\"20-df-bm-game\">20-df-bm-game</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bm-strategy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{StrategyBM}_i(s)\\Longleftrightarrow s:H_i\\to2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall h\\in H_i\\ [\\operatorname{last}(h)\\prec s(h)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FollowsBM}_i(p,s)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{LegalBM}(p)\\land\n\\forall n\\ [p\\upharpoonright(n+1)\\in H_i\\Rightarrow p(n+1)=s(p\\upharpoonright(n+1))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,I}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\\n[\\operatorname{StrategyBM}_I(s)\\land\\forall p\\ (\\operatorname{FollowsBM}_I(p,s)\\Rightarrow X(p)\\in A)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,II}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\\n[\\operatorname{StrategyBM}_{II}(s)\\land\\forall p\\ (\\operatorname{FollowsBM}_{II}(p,s)\\Rightarrow X(p)\\notin A)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bm-strategy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{StrategyBM}_i(s)\\Longleftrightarrow s:H_i\\to2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall h\\in H_i\\ [\\operatorname{last}(h)\\prec s(h)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FollowsBM}_i(p,s)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{LegalBM}(p)\\land\n\\forall n\\ [p\\upharpoonright(n+1)\\in H_i\\Rightarrow p(n+1)=s(p\\upharpoonright(n+1))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,I}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\\n[\\operatorname{StrategyBM}_I(s)\\land\\forall p\\ (\\operatorname{FollowsBM}_I(p,s)\\Rightarrow X(p)\\in A)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,II}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\\n[\\operatorname{StrategyBM}_{II}(s)\\land\\forall p\\ (\\operatorname{FollowsBM}_{II}(p,s)\\Rightarrow X(p)\\notin A)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对局序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的第 0 项固定为空，II 先作非空选择。策略函数的域是全部该玩家回合的合法有限历史，不只实际某条对局。所有遵循策略的合法对局都要获胜。</p>\n<p>来源：§14.1.3 的策略定义展开；印刷页 212, 213；PDF 第 241, 242 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-bm-game","status":"resolved","id":"f02918e259cd9a8e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-bm-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-bm-game","status":"resolved","id":"f02918e259cd9a8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"(\\sigma_0,\\ldots,\\sigma_n)","display":false},{"tex":"H_I=\\{h\\in H:n\\text{ 奇}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"H_{II}=\\{h\\in H:n\\text{ 偶}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{I,II\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bm-strategy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{StrategyBM}_i(s)\\Longleftrightarrow s:H_i\\to2^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall h\\in H_i\\ [\\operatorname{last}(h)\\prec s(h)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{FollowsBM}_i(p,s)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{LegalBM}(p)\\land\n\\forall n\\ [p\\upharpoonright(n+1)\\in H_i\\Rightarrow p(n+1)=s(p\\upharpoonright(n+1))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,I}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\\n[\\operatorname{StrategyBM}_I(s)\\land\\forall p\\ (\\operatorname{FollowsBM}_I(p,s)\\Rightarrow X(p)\\in A)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{WinningStrategy}_{BM,II}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\\n[\\operatorname{StrategyBM}_{II}(s)\\land\\forall p\\ (\\operatorname{FollowsBM}_{II}(p,s)\\Rightarrow X(p)\\notin A)].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1849,"backlinks":[{"id":"088f0b71a9b22ef9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]；see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]；see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-thm-baire-category]]。"},{"id":"c989c60a7c30291e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-game]]；see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]。"},{"id":"19c8ea5f8ad3f6d0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-bm-strategy]]；see [[20-df-relative-category]]；see [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]。"}],"outgoing":["f02918e259cd9a8e"]}